      "text": "--> kafka absorbs spike while \nconsumers process at their own space.\n--> metrics will persit in kafka until topic is consumed\n--> support processing data ion parallel. \n--> kafka can add complexity and latency. \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> kafka absorbs spike while \nconsumers process at their own space.\n--> metrics will persit in kafka until topic is consumed\n--> support processing data ion parallel. \n--> kafka can add complexity and latency. \n",
