      "text": "\n-- instead server publish directly to\ningestion service, we can run small\nbackground process on each server.\nThis is similar to DataDog or OTEL\n1. Collect metrics locally at high\nfrequency\n2. Buffers and batches metrics\nlocally\n3. Periodically flushes batches via Kafka\n==> this solution shifts work to the edge,\nreduce central ingestion load. Agent can also\nhandle local aggregation. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n-- instead server publish directly to\ningestion service, we can run small\nbackground process on each server.\nThis is similar to DataDog or OTEL\n1. Collect metrics locally at high\nfrequency\n2. Buffers and batches metrics\nlocally\n3. Periodically flushes batches via Kafka\n==> this solution shifts work to the edge,\nreduce central ingestion load. Agent can also\nhandle local aggregation. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
