    },
    {
      "id": "w6xc2ykjk6efnqS-tQecg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 93.564453125,
      "y": 2904.681640625,
      "width": 662.2907104492188,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1688819264,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 1004705344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786684678961,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sources and sinks are the entry and exit points for data in your\nFlink application.\n-- Sources read data from external systems and convert them into\nFlink streams. Common sources:\nKafka: For message queues\nKinesis: For AWS streaming data\nFile systems: For batch processing\nCustom sources: For specialized integrations\n\n\n-- Sinks write data from Flink streams to external systems.\nCommon sinks:\nDatabases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, etc.\nData warehouses: Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift\nMessage queues: Kafka, RabbitMQ\nFile systems: HDFS, S3, local files",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sources and sinks are the entry and exit points for data in your Flink application.\n-- Sources read data from external systems and convert them into Flink streams. Common sources:\nKafka: For message queues\nKinesis: For AWS streaming data\nFile systems: For batch processing\nCustom sources: For specialized integrations\n\n\n-- Sinks write data from Flink streams to external systems. Common sinks:\nDatabases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, etc.\nData warehouses: Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift\nMessage queues: Kafka, RabbitMQ\nFile systems: HDFS, S3, local files",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0kuYhIvWiTJSsAx81tiWP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 97.955078125,
      "y": 2876.755859375,
      "width": 135.8998565673828,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
