      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786685486171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "provide job-centric debugging experience. When a model fails at step 18,204, we correlate model metrics, rank progress, GPU health,\nNCCL communication, node/network events and scheduler events around that exact timestamp and automatically identify the most\nanomalous rank/node/GPU.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "provide job-centric debugging experience. When a model fails at step 18,204, we correlate model metrics, rank progress, GPU health, NCCL communication, node/network events and scheduler events around that exact timestamp and automatically identify the most anomalous rank/node/GPU.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1WyLNLBk8v-kFqP4dwDbF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 806.212890625,
      "y": 4614.181640625,
      "width": 708.4153442382812,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1187251648,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 66966976,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786685512741,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We need to priotize:\n\n1. Training: loss, step time, tokens/sec, gradient norm, NaN/Inf.\n2. GPU: utilization, memory, Tensor Core/SM activity, temperature/power.\n3. Distributed: collective latency, communication ratio, rank heartbeat, straggler detection.\n4. Hardware: XID, ECC, NVLink/NVSwitch errors, PCIe errors.\n5. Data pipeline: dataloader latency and queue depth.\n6. Network: bandwidth, drops/retransmits, RDMA errors.\n7. Host: CPU/memory/disk.\n8. Scheduler: queue time, restart/preemption, allocation vs actual GPU utilization.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We need to priotize:\n\n1. Training: loss, step time, tokens/sec, gradient norm, NaN/Inf.\n2. GPU: utilization, memory, Tensor Core/SM activity, temperature/power.\n3. Distributed: collective latency, communication ratio, rank heartbeat, straggler detection.\n4. Hardware: XID, ECC, NVLink/NVSwitch errors, PCIe errors.\n5. Data pipeline: dataloader latency and queue depth.\n6. Network: bandwidth, drops/retransmits, RDMA errors.\n7. Host: CPU/memory/disk.\n8. Scheduler: queue time, restart/preemption, allocation vs actual GPU utilization.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
